  "description": "APPLICATION FOR VARIATION OF CONDITION 2 (APPROVED PLANS), ATTACHED TO LBM PLANNING APPLICATION 22/P0315 ENLARGEMENT OF EXISTING BASEMENT, ERECTION OF A SINGLE STOREY EXTENSION AND INTERNAL ALTERATIONS.CHANGES RELATE TO PROPOSED DEMOLITION AND REPLACEMENT OF FLANK WALLS AT GROUND AND 1ST FLOOR LEVEL AND REPLACEMENT OF FENESTRATION AT 1ST FLOOR LEVEL ON NORTH SIDE ELEVATION",
  "decision_conditions": [
